ki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" href=\"?note=a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-step\">56-df-rewrite-step</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e295b2b3159f2b40\" href=\"?note=e295b2b3159f2b40\" title=\"56-df-normal-form\">56-df-normal-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"55c39f44acb2211c\" href=\"?note=55c39f44acb2211c\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-relation\">56-df-rewrite-relation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§4.9 Definition 4.9.5(iii)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"131"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>152</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"原书OCR文本陈述已逐项比对；证明核验范围见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span> 和规则集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a>；这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,V\">\\(F,V\\)</span> 分别实例化上游的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F,\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_R\">\\(\\to_R\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"55c39f44acb2211c\" href=\"?note=55c39f44acb2211c\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-relation\">56-df-rewrite-relation</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"34fb9d07dfbad48c\" href=\"?note=34fb9d07dfbad48c\" title=\"56-df-orthogonal\">56-df-orthogonal</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\\in T\">\\(t,u\\in T\\)</span>，正规形见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"e295b2b3159f2b40\" href=\"?note=e295b2b3159f2b40\" title=\"56-df-normal-form\">56-df-normal-form</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(p,q\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}\">\\(&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a> 中前缀优先的字典序，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RedexPos}_R(t)\">\\(\\mathrm{RedexPos}_R(t)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" href=\"?note=a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-step\">56-df-rewrite-step</a>。位置、子项、子项替换、替换作用见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"c3157a722a0edf96\" href=\"?note=c3157a722a0edf96\" title=\"56-df-subterm\">56-df-subterm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"b58d01262349aaf3\" href=\"?note=b58d01262349aaf3\" title=\"56-df-replace\">56-df-replace</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{NO}_{\\Sigma,V,R}:={}&amp;\\{(t,t):t\\in T\\land\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_R,t)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(t,t[r\\sigma]_p):t\\in T,\\;(l,r)\\in R,\\;\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma,V),\\;\np\\in\\mathrm{RedexPos}_R(t),\\;t|_p=l\\sigma,\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{40mm}\\neg\\exists q\\in\\mathrm{RedexPos}_R(t)\\;(q&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}p)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{NO}_{\\Sigma,V,R}:={}&amp;\\{(t,t):t\\in T\\land\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_R,t)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(t,t[r\\sigma]_p):t\\in T,\\;(l,r)\\in R,\\;\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma,V),\\;\np\\in\\mathrm{RedexPos}_R(t),\\;t|_p=l\\sigma,\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{40mm}\\neg\\exists q\\in\\mathrm{RedexPos}_R(t)\\;(q&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}p)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NO}_{\\Sigma,V,R}:T\\to T.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NO}_{\\Sigma,V,R}:T\\to T.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>前序先访问父节点，再从左到右访问子树；取最先红项自动给出最左最外位置。有限非空红项位置集有唯一最小位置；正交性使该位置的收缩结果唯一（同一规则匹配只在左端变量上相关，右端不添变量），故所给图是T→T的函数。正规形处取恒等，不对空集合取min。与原书一样，正交前提使仅凭位置足以选定规则；此处没有对一般歧义TRS声称函数单值。</p>\n<p>来源定位中的 <code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 指本地提取文本的页块序号，不宣称是DjVu物理页码；印刷页已按该页页眉或页脚核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-orthogonal","status":"resolved","id":"34fb9d07dfbad48c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-orthogonal]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-position","status":"resolved","id":"da02033e6d596cae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-position]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-subterm","status":"resolved","id":"c3157a722a